{"id":"sh/n2l4fq98","kind":"textbox","name":"text","position":{"left":64,"top":299,"width":345,"height":250},"text":"《中小学书法教育指导纲要》\n将书法纳入中小学教学体系。\n\n“双减”后的课后服务\n与学校美育建设，持续需要\n优质书法教育内容。","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#365567","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/m1c3mlsn","kind":"textbox","name":"text","position":{"left":465,"top":299,"width":345,"height":104},"text":"家长重视传统文化、专注力与\n审美素养，并为课程和工具投入\n稳定的学期预算。","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#365567","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
