{"id":"sh/x8nml0ra","kind":"textbox","name":"text","position":{"left":866,"top":299,"width":350,"height":250},"text":"平板与手写笔逐步普及，\n高校无纸化学习尤其突出。\n\n书写介质改变后，用户仍需练习\n以适应书写体验；电子纸也有助于\n减少纸张消耗。","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#365567","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
